<view class="screen"><view class="mode-banner">{{modeLabel}}</view><view wx:if="{{imageError}}" class="note">部分图片暂时无法读取，请稍后刷新。商品和订单信息以文字为准。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在读取好物…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-box"><text>{{error}}</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="refresh" loading="{{loading}}">重新读取</button><button class="text-button" data-page="mine" bindtap="go">前往我的</button></view><view wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}"><text class="eyebrow">MEET THE LOCAL BUYER</text><text class="page-title">让懂家乡的人，替你挑</text><text class="body-copy">店铺、介绍及采购者资料均为模拟展示。</text><view wx:for="{{shops}}" wx:key="id" class="surface" data-page="shop" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="go"><view class="shop-row plain"><image class="shop-icon" src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill" binderror="imageFailed"/><view class="grow"><text class="heading">{{item.name}}</text><text class="muted">{{item.regionLabel}}</text></view><text>→</text></view><text class="body-copy">{{item.description}}</text><text class="tag">{{item.preview ? '筹备中' : item.productIds.length + ' 款模拟好物'}}</text></view></view><view class="bottom-space"></view></view>
